## Data

The analyses performed in this pipeline are based on publicly available multi-omics datasets and on data files derived or prepared from these public resources.

The following files were used to run the pipeline.

### IBS dataset — PRJNA812699

* `Patients.csv` *
* `metadata1.csv` *
* `metadata2.csv` *
* `16s_data.csv` (publicly available source file)
* `16s_taxonomy_table_updated.csv` (publicly available source file)
* `Transcripts_KO_data.csv` (publicly available source file)
* `metabolomics_data.csv` (publicly available source file)

These files provide the patient metadata, taxonomic, metatranscriptomic, and metabolomic data used for the primary IBS multi-omics analysis.

### IBDMDB/HMP2 dataset

* `taxonomic_profiles_3.tsv.gz` (publicly available source file)
* `metadata_metagenomics.csv` (publicly available source file)
* `HMP2_metabolomics_w_metadata.biom` (publicly available source file)

These files provide the metagenomic taxonomic profiles, sample metadata, and metabolomic data used for the external cross-disease analysis.

* Files generated or prepared from the publicly available source datasets for use in the present analysis.
